5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard equipment is old. I need to know if the new system talks to our scanners.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Headline prices lie. I want to see what we actually paid in renewals over the years.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Last winter, nobody owned the outage. I need to check who was responsible for support.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I am curious about the dispatch tool. It feels like it is aging quietly in place.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We are short on people. I worry about the administrators who know the system best.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, if the renewals are high, the total cost is a trap.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, exactly. I am looking at the invoice history to find the hidden costs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the dispatch tool is old. I am checking the support ownership to see the gaps.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
