14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I will check the administrator retirements. We need to know who is leaving.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will also look at the yard devices. They are the physical reality.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also check the board minutes. Capital requests are often trimmed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will also look at the warehouse rule changes. Scope creep is a risk.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will also check the data lift from 2018. External work often needs repair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also look at the depot supervisors. They shape the daily routines.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
