35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard scanners are a mix of old models. The 2021 trial failed because of spreadsheets.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Renewals for separate pieces climbed yearly. Bundled agreements held price. Capital requests were trimmed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Support was scattered across four suppliers. The outage sat unowned for two days. Scope changed twice.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. The 2018 data lift had mismatched codes for a year.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,Two administrators retire this year. The last hiring posting stayed open for eleven months.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, if separate pieces cost more, we need a bundled solution to control spend.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, yes. The data shows bundled is cheaper long-term. I am worried about the hidden operating lines.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the unowned outage is terrifying. We need a single point of accountability for support.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, agreed. The data lift issues show external teams need close supervision.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the yard devices are a mess. The new system must work with what we have.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The peak season has no freeze window. A cutover then would be a disaster.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The board trims capital but lets operating costs slide. We must watch the subscription fees.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The warehouse rules changed twice. The initial plan is useless. We need flexibility.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,The dispatch tool is stuck. We need a system that can be upgraded in parts.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"The supervisors dropped the new routines quickly. Training must be deep, not just a visit.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
